WEBVTT

00:02:31.230 --> 00:02:35.526
Now today, I'm just going
to draw out four key findings,

00:02:35.568 --> 00:02:38.237
and I'm also going to go through
a few dos and don'ts

00:02:38.279 --> 00:02:44.452
for leaders who want to navigate
this territory proactively, productively.

00:02:45.786 --> 00:02:47.496
So let me start with a question.

00:02:47.997 --> 00:02:52.627
When I say the word "activist,"

00:02:52.668 --> 00:02:54.086
what comes to mind?

00:02:55.588 --> 00:03:00.218
What images, what thoughts,
what assumptions?